# Copy to .env only for non-secret local overrides. .env is gitignored and the
# Makefile loads it automatically (`-include .env` + `export`).
#
# Permanent fixture addresses, users, pinned host keys, devices, and model-cache
# identity are fixed repository configuration. Fixture-scoped SSH private keys
# are supplied only through the documented local/CI setup boundary. Provider
# API credentials and dirty-host retention switches are intentionally absent.
